{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/339126-htv-lfg","id":339126,"title":"HtV LFG","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-13T09:13:20-08:00","id":339126,"title":"HtV LFG","content":"Hello, im a new player looking for a group, not much else to say really besides that im a newbie to Hunter and i really want to find a group to join.<br /> <br /> You can post here or if you want to directly talk to me, you can email me at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#86d4e7e8e7f2e9f5edc6ffe7eee9e9a8e5e9eb\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"46142728273229352d063f272e29296825292b\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><br /> <br /> im really desperate, ive been looking all over for a group, please v.v<br /> <br /> EDIT: Im in the Louisville area, forgot to mention that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3925,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3925-ranatosk","user":"Ranatosk","date":". 12-15-2014, 08:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3925-ranatosk","name":"Ranatosk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T09:17:07-08:00","id":339132,"title":"","content":"If you are hoping to meet in person, then I need to know your location.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4462-nohwear","name":"Nohwear","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T17:53:45-08:00","id":341407,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nohwear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/339126-htv-lfg?p=339132#post339132\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you are hoping to meet in person, then I need to know your location.</div> </div> </div> </div>oh, right, my apologies, im in the Louisville area.<br /> <br /> ill be sure to edit my original message to include this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3925-ranatosk","name":"Ranatosk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T20:29:11-08:00","id":342565,"title":"","content":"bumping to prevent this topic from dying like the last LFG one","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3925-ranatosk","name":"Ranatosk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T08:43:48-08:00","id":348359,"title":"","content":"Bumping to prevent this thread from dying","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3925-ranatosk","name":"Ranatosk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T12:10:01-08:00","id":349983,"title":"","content":"Well, you haven't specified how you wanna play, whether it'd be offline or online, live or PBP, so I'm gonna assume you aren't really picky about how you play, you just wanna play.<br /> <br /> One option you might wanna look into is Cardians. It's a group on DeviantART dedicated to playing HtV with a custom Conspiracy called the Cardian Syndicate. As the name suggests, it's a criminal syndicate where members are ranked based on card numbers and grouped in suits. Basically, Hearts are diplomats and social chameleons, Clubs are fighters and bouncers, Diamonds are crafters and money-makers, and Spades are detectives and spies. Ace is the highest rank, they're the leaders of their suits. Naturally, fresh recruits start at rank 2.<br /> <br /> Being a global Conspiracy, there are many divisions all throughout the world. This are where the different player groups come in. When a division opens up, the STs for that division(called GMs in the group) usually host a meet n' greet in the chatroom which is where you can interact with others on the waiting list. Because this is a social game, the GMs wanna have players that will mesh well together. That said, there doesn't seem to be any divisions opening up at the moment, but I'm sure there will be one soon.<br /> <br /> In fact, I'm thinking of opening one up myself, though it will be a while before that happens. In any case, if you're looking for a Hunter group to play in, I'd highly recommend at least checking it out.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T12:38:36-08:00","id":352988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/339126-htv-lfg?p=349983#post349983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, you haven't specified how you wanna play, whether it'd be offline or online, live or PBP, so I'm gonna assume you aren't really picky about how you play, you just wanna play.<br /> <br /> One option you might wanna look into is Cardians. It's a group on DeviantART dedicated to playing HtV with a custom Conspiracy called the Cardian Syndicate. As the name suggests, it's a criminal syndicate where members are ranked based on card numbers and grouped in suits. Basically, Hearts are diplomats and social chameleons, Clubs are fighters and bouncers, Diamonds are crafters and money-makers, and Spades are detectives and spies. Ace is the highest rank, they're the leaders of their suits. Naturally, fresh recruits start at rank 2.<br /> <br /> Being a global Conspiracy, there are many divisions all throughout the world. This are where the different player groups come in. When a division opens up, the STs for that division(called GMs in the group) usually host a meet n' greet in the chatroom which is where you can interact with others on the waiting list. Because this is a social game, the GMs wanna have players that will mesh well together. That said, there doesn't seem to be any divisions opening up at the moment, but I'm sure there will be one soon.<br /> <br /> In fact, I'm thinking of opening one up myself, though it will be a while before that happens. In any case, if you're looking for a Hunter group to play in, I'd highly recommend at least checking it out.</div> </div> </div> </div>sorry, im pretty new at this sorta, im personally fine with online play via Skype or whatever, ive never done a PbP sorta game, but im willing to give it a go.<br /> <br /> im also okay with a LARP if its local and not on saturday afternoons, only on saturday nights, at least after 6:20 PM.<br /> <br /> if you want to find out anything about my skype or whatever, PM me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3925,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3925-ranatosk","user":"Ranatosk","date":". 12-28-2014, 03:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3925-ranatosk","name":"Ranatosk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}